    *   *Strategic Alignment (5/5):* Directly fulfills the NHS Long Term Plan Ageing Well standard.
    *   *Multi-Horizon (4/5):* Rapidly diverts admissions (Short) and prevents irreversible functional decline in frail populations (Medium/Long).
    *   *Inequality (4/5):* Provides proactive, home-based care to vulnerable patients living in socioeconomically deprived areas.

