    *   *Cost-Effectiveness (3/5):* Upfront investments in staff wellbeing and safe staffing ratios are offset by reduced expensive locum agency costs.
    *   *Strategic Alignment (4/5):* Aligned with the NHS Long Term Workforce Plan commitments.
    *   *Multi-Horizon (4/5):* Reduces winter sickness absence (Short) and builds a resilient healthcare workforce (Medium/Long).
    *   *Inequality (3/5):* Protects lower-salaried NHS support staff (HCAs, porters, domestic teams) facing physical and financial strain.

