## E. Evidence Gaps & Research Needs

1.  **Long-Term Cost-Effectiveness of Virtual Wards:** While short-term readmission rates are well-documented, long-term economic evaluations across varying Integrated Care Board structures remain limited.
2.  **Air Quality Metrics & Nosocomial Transmission Rates:** High-quality clinical trials measuring the direct reduction of nosocomial viral infections (COVID-19, Flu, RSV) via localized upper-room UV-C or HEPA air filtration in crowded NHS waiting rooms are needed.
3.  **Digital Disparity Impact of App-Based Access:** Further evaluation is required to determine whether rapid transition to app-based digital primary care triage exacerbates health inequalities among socioeconomically disadvantaged or digitally excluded populations.

